  "description": "The meme is designed for a broad online audience familiar with internet humor, satire, and visual memes. It relies on the audience recognizing the absurdity of the comparison between humans and gorillas, as well as the cultural reference to evolutionary determinism and the historical anti-Black stereotype of comparing Black people to primates. The humor is intended for viewers who understand and appreciate ironic or absurdist analogies, even if they may not be aware of the underlying harmful implications.",
